+#### [Flowise](https://github.com/FlowiseAI/Flowise)
+> **Description:** Flowise is a drag-and-drop builder for LLM apps and agent workflows. Its GitHub README positions it as a low-code way to connect models, memory, tools, vector stores, and APIs into production-ready flows. For real estate teams, that maps well to buyer intake bots, listing FAQ assistants, and brokerage knowledge copilots that need a visual editor instead of a full custom codebase. The project is actively maintained and has a broad integration surface for RAG, multi-step automation, and chat widgets. Last commit date: 2026-03-31. Stars count: 40k+. Primary language: TypeScript. License type: Apache-2.0.
